---
---
<header class="mx-auto flex max-w-shell items-baseline justify-between gap-6 px-gutter pt-10">
  <span class="whitespace-nowrap font-latin text-[22px] font-medium tracking-latin text-ink">Body OD</span>
  <span class="text-right font-sans text-micro font-light leading-[1.8] tracking-jp text-ink-muted">
    身体を入口にした<br />場と空気の探究
  </span>
</header>
<div class="mx-auto max-w-shell px-gutter">
  <hr class="mt-6 border-0 border-t border-line" />
</div>

<section class="relative mx-auto max-w-shell overflow-hidden px-gutter pt-hero pb-section">

  <!-- Background illustration -->
  <img
    src="/il/open.png"
    alt=""
    aria-hidden="true"
    class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 h-full w-full select-none object-contain object-right opacity-[0.07] sm:opacity-30"
  />

  <!-- Content -->
  <div class="relative max-w-measure">
    <div class="mb-10">
      <span class="block h-[9px] w-[9px] rounded-full bg-seal"></span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="font-serif text-anchor font-normal text-ink">ととのえたら、<br />ゆるんで、<br />ほどける。</h1>

    <p class="mt-12 max-w-[520px] font-sans text-lede font-light text-ink-soft">
      認知の前にある身体の状態<br />身体性を土台にした、場と空気の探究
    </p>
  </div>

</section>
